        {
            "code": "As soon as a code has been redeemed, you’ll start receiving its bonuses and boosts. For example, if you’ve redeemed a code that gives you an x2 EXP Bonus, you’ll see the timer start ticking down immediately, so make sure you’re in a good spot before redeeming them. You can also stack EXP boosts, so if you have time to spare, ensure you’ve activated a few before embarking on your journey.",
